  <item>
    <title>Lots of goodbyes</title>
    <link>https://hobobiker-prep.ddev.site/lots_of_goodbyes</link>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Jeff decided that 1000 miles of the Great Divide route was enough for him and that he&#039;d head on back. We said goodbye to him in the wind on the way to Antelope Wells, and he&#039;ll either ride to Denver or take the bus there from El Paso, then return to New York. So we had sad goodbyes on the highway!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Then we got to the border and Ron and I said goodbye to Wim and Tiny as they rode back to Hachita to prepare for the ride to El Paso to catch their plane back to Holland!&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
